# Copy to `.env.local` (git-ignored) and adjust. Vite only exposes variables that start with VITE_.

# Contact form endpoint. The form POSTs JSON { "name", "email", "message" } here and treats any
# 2xx response as success. Leave it unset (or empty) and the form simulates a successful send after
# ~800ms and logs a one-line notice in the dev console, so the UI can be built before a backend exists.
# The endpoint must allow cross-origin POSTs with a JSON content type if it lives on another origin.
VITE_CONTACT_ENDPOINT=
